# ref-a2e4816-recycle-off-when-speculative-off
# A box rests on a flat ground box. Contact recycling is only enabled when both
# bodies enable it AND speculative contact is on (box3d a2e4816). Without
# speculative points an empty pair may be closer than the speculative distance,
# so those contacts must never recycle. This scene pins the resting contact
# stays stable (the box does not sink) across the run.
# Reference: vanilla float box3d at upstream commit a2e4816.
# Observable: the resting box height and the contact count.
expect pos 0.002 rot 0.001 vel 0.01 horizon 60 counts exact
world gravity 0 -10 0 dt 1 60 substeps 4 steps 60
body static position 0 -0.5 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
shape 0 box 10 0.5 10 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
body dynamic position 0 0.5 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
shape 1 box 0.5 0.5 0.5 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
